        "# To get new variations of your image, change the seed value in the KSampler node.\n\n# For bigger stylistic changes, experiment with different samplers and schedulers.\n\n# Try these samplers: euler, heun, lcm, res_multistep, er_sde, uni_pc\n\n# Good schedulers: simple, normal, sgm_uniform, beta, linear_quadratic\n\n# Mix and match to see what produces the most interesting results."
