      "title": "Model links",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "We are using quantized weights in this workflow, the original SmoothMix WAN 2.2 Model repo is [here](https://civitai.com/models/1995784?modelVersionId=2259006)\n\n\n## Model links\n\n**Clip**\n\n- [umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/tree/main/split_files/text_encoders)\n\n**Unet models**\n\n- [smoothMixWan22I2VT2V_i2vHigh-Q4_K_M.gguf](https://huggingface.co/Bedovyy/smoothMixWan22-I2V-GGUF/tree/main/HighNoise)\n\n- [smoothMixWan22I2VT2V_i2vLow-Q4_K_M.gguf](https://huggingface.co/Bedovyy/smoothMixWan22-I2V-GGUF/tree/main/LowNoise)\n\n**VAE**\n\n- [wan_2.1_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/tree/main)\n\n\n**Upscale Model**\n\n- [2xLexicaRRDBNet_Sharp.pth](https://huggingface.co/Thelocallab/2xLexicaRRDBNet_Sharp/blob/main/2xLexicaRRDBNet_Sharp.pth)\n\nModel Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │      └── umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 unet/\n│   │      └── smoothMixWan22I2VT2V_i2vHigh-Q4_K_M.gguf\n               smoothMixWan22I2VT2V_i2vLow-Q4_K_M.gguf\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│          └── wan_2.1_vae.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 upscale_models/\n│          └── 2xLexicaRRDBNet_Sharp.pth\n```\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
